# Stash iOS/iPadOS override: import alongside an existing node subscription.
# 在 Stash 中导入并启用此覆写，置于其他覆写之前，然后选择 Siri-ChatGPT 节点。
# Arrays are prepended by Stash; existing routing and DNS settings are preserved.
name: Siri AI & ChatGPT
desc: |-
  Siri、Apple Intelligence、PCC 与 ChatGPT 分流；启用后在 Siri-ChatGPT 中选择节点。 / Select a node in Siri-ChatGPT after enabling.
  版本日期 / Updated: 2026-09-22 11:31 UTC+8
  最低系统版本 / Minimum OS version: 27
author: Leosu16
homepage: https://github.com/Leosu16/enableMacSiriAI
date: 2026-09-22 11:31 UTC+8
proxy-groups:
- name: Siri-ChatGPT
  type: select
  include-all: true
dns:
  fake-ip-filter:
  - staging.apple-carry-relay.cloudflare.com
rules:
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,siri.apple.com,Siri-ChatGPT
- DOMAIN,ropes.apple.com,Siri-ChatGPT
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-intelligence.apple.com,Siri-ChatGPT
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ai.apple.com,Siri-ChatGPT
- DOMAIN-SUFFIX,guzzoni.apple.com,Siri-ChatGPT
